{"id":"vod_sn_38200","vodId":"38200","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"萌之英语单词","name_cn":"萌之英语单词","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/bb432aec9baa99d9db8f86177990b4a6.jpg"},"summary":"虹原茵可（田村由香里 配音）是一名高中三年级的女生，虽然已经十七岁的，但身高只有一米五的她看起来像个小学生一样。身高问题是茵可的死穴，每每被戳到死穴，她都会暴跳如雷。茵可暗恋着名为小直（上田佑司 配音）的男生，小直是茵可青梅竹马的玩伴，两人自幼便相识，为了能够待在小直的身边，茵可决定帮助小直补习他十分不擅长的英文，但前提是，茵可会变身为拥有超能力的魔法少女。　　亭亭玉立温文尔雅的大小姐黑威澄（户松遥 配音）也同样喜欢着小直，她也拥有变身成为魔法少女的能力，猫君（桧山修之 配音）是她的魔法使。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:59:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/PAab76kjjH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/EgimEuyPm51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tFczDY2hSz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/7zfwSsM1sD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/2WaBfQmFay1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/suuiBiZhKG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/wWAAFLHa5S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/gXRp1bYeZP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/MJymM9mvkC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/n8HFV7kSTY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DDDutn2P2P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/G3vu95KwQn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/62UQrw2eUE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/6H0NeDxF1Y1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:01.659Z"}